<title>USA: Pewamo-Westphalia CS, Mich., won by EVEREN.</title>
<headline>Pewamo-Westphalia CS, Mich., won by EVEREN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities said it won $7.135 million of Pewamo-Westphalia CS, Mich., general obligation 1997 school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.13 percent.</p>
</text>
